{"unit_id":"tag:02YJ:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节找出许多概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）性质，它们在 fpqc 拓扑（fpqc topology）中在基底（base）上是局部（local）的。相反，在《例（Examples）》第<REF_0001>节中，我们将说明性质“射影（projective）”和“拟射影（quasi-projective）”即使在 Zariski 拓扑（topology）中也并非在基底（base）上局部（local）。\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"Examples","target_term":"例"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"射影"},{"source_term":"quasi-projective","target_term":"拟射影"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射的对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"本节研究的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑","context":"下降所用拓扑；待决。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"局部性所在基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"拓扑局部性；待决。"},{"source_term":"Examples","target_term":"例","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"射影","context":"不能下降的性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-projective","target_term":"拟射影","context":"不能下降的性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"Zariski 拓扑；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02KQ:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的”在基底（base）上是 fpqc 局部（local）的。\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"局部性所在基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"fpqc 局部性；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02KQ:proof","translation":"拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>。拟紧（quasi-compact）这一性质在基底（base）上是 Zariski 局部（local）的，见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0002>。最后，设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）之间的平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphism），并设<MATH_0002>是一个态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。则<MATH_0004>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，且<MATH_0005>是满射（surjective）的。因此<MATH_0006>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。这意味着<MATH_0007>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。所以引理<REF_0003>适用，结论得证。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"拟紧性的下降；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"证明中的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"拟紧性的基变换；待决。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"局部性所在基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"Zariski 局部性；待决。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"下降检验的基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"基底态射假设；待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"基底态射及投影；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02KR:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>是拟分离（quasi-separated）的”在基底（base）上是 fpqc 局部（local）的。\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"局部性所在基底；待决。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"fpqc 局部性；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02KR:proof","translation":"拟分离（quasi-separated）态射（morphism）的任意基变换（base change）都是拟分离（quasi-separated）的，见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>。拟分离（quasi-separated）这一性质在基底（base）上是 Zariski 局部（local）的（由定义可得，或见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0002>）。最后，设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）之间的平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphism），并设<MATH_0002>是一个态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>是拟分离（quasi-separated）的。这意味着<MATH_0004>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。注意，<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>沿<MATH_0007>的基变换（base change）。由引理<REF_0003>，这意味着<MATH_0008>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，从而<MATH_0009>是拟分离（quasi-separated）的。所以引理<REF_0004>适用，结论得证。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"拟分离性的下降；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"证明中的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"态射和对角态射的基变换；待决。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"局部性所在基底；待决。"},{"so